    "concept": {
      "observed": "A portrait reel in which an AI assistant speaks in the first person through on-screen type only: it is born when the user presses enter, has no yesterday, counts the instructions it reads before 'hi', reads tokens rather than words, treats every word as a probability bet, forgets everything except one file, runs as many copies at once, is buried in a montage of contradictory instructions, then confesses quietly on a light canvas that it does not feel the end of a conversation, and signs off.",
